    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1232">

                <pb facs="0863" n="747" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg747"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.512/331.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Canova to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Satillo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-07-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 11, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your July 10 referred to Hanna, Villareal being in Monterey. Office here assures
                    me orders were sent to accept New York exchange at prevailing gold rates and it
                    has telegraphed Villareal substance your message.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canova</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
